definition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","quote":"研究时期：筛选期4周；双盲治疗期52周（含第0–12周剂量探索期与第12–52周PoC确证期）；安全性随访4周。","quote_sha256":"c854e902d69b8042b9a3c84b6dca275ab43f68d29187a2340d59958e309703c3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","span_id":"es3"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂缓释片对照（外观、气味、规格与KZ-HS501匹配），每日一次口服，用法与试验组一致","quote_sha256":"2e88dccfd7d3c5d34c99a3e98467a94d06c4669fcbcedfb27690d6a7a53e429e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","span_id":"es4"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es1","es2","es3","es4"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"需确认剂量调整、暂停、恢复与永久停药规则及对应AE或实验室阈值","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_6_1","missing_source_classes":["剂量调整规则","安全性管理方案"],"target":"6 研究治疗/干预"},{"action":"需确认合并用药与禁限用药清单及救援治疗定义","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_6_2","missing_source_classes":["合并用药清单","救援治疗方案"],"target":"6 研究治疗/干预"}],"heading":"研究治疗/干预","missing_source_classes":["剂量调整与停药规则","合并用药与禁限用药清单","救援治疗定义","药物过量与给药错误处理流程"],"proposal_text":"本研究为多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照的II期临床研究，旨在评价KZ-HS501（口服选择性TYK2变构抑制剂缓释片）在中重度化脓性汗腺炎成人受试者中的概念验证与剂量探索。试验干预为KZ-HS501缓释片口服，每日一次，每次一片，设5mg、15mg、30mg三个剂量层；对照为外观、气味、规格与KZ-HS501匹配的安慰剂缓释片，每日一次口服，用法与试验组一致。组间按1:1:1:1平行分组，分层随机因素为基线HAS-IHS疼痛评分与Hurley分期。给药方式为整片吞服，不可掰开、压碎或咀嚼，空腹或餐后均可但每位受试者须固定各自给药条件；漏服当日不补服，次日正常继续。研究时期包括筛选期4周、双盲治疗期52周（其中第0至12周为剂量探索期，第12至52周为PoC确证期）以及安全性随访4周。剂量探索期每2周随访一次（第2、4、6、8、10、12周），PoC期每4周随访一次（第16、20、24、28、32、36、40、44、48周），第52周为终访，第56周为安全性随访访视。主要疗效终点为第16周达到HiSCR75的受试者比例，主要安全性终点为治疗期严重不良事件与导致研究药物停药的不良事件发生率（至第52周）。","rationale":"本章正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的总体设计、给药方案、分组与分层、研究时期与访视策略、主要终点等条目撰写。剂量探索期与PoC期的时间划分、1:1:1:1分组、分层随机因素、漏服处理规则、整片吞服要求、空腹或餐后固定条件均为已确认事实。访视频率与具体时间点亦为已确认内容。需医学经理确认：各访视具体评估项目清单、剂量调整或暂停/恢复/永久停药规则、合并用药与禁限用药清单、救援治疗定义、药物过量处理流程等实施细节尚未在允许来源中给出。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_f4646e04bf3f_b351f8cf343e56d8","section_number":"6","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:84108f69c18a3caebea4ea31","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e35a8dbd3c7941"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261011030030_c12c8bc4","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","quote":"KZ-HS501缓释片（5mg/15mg/30mg薄膜衣片）每日一次口服，每次一片，整片吞服不可掰开、压碎或咀嚼，空腹或餐后均可（固定各自给药条件）；安慰剂缓释片同法每日一次口服；漏服当日不补服，次日正常继续。","quote_sha256":"6844e8d8f294af1d5e05352dcbb9bb02af8d11acc8483688d3fa3b874f7cf5a9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","span_id":"es1"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","quote":"组间1:1:1:1平行分组（5mg/15mg/30mg剂量层与安慰剂），分层随机（按基线HAS-IHS疼痛评分与Hurley分期分层）。","quote_sha256":"4a7f1aa9011cc36eb7c8f7cd8ccfbb6d475ae6490d94f7cf5535fe6abb669049","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","span_id":"es2"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂缓释片对照（外观、气味、规格与KZ-HS501匹配），每日一次口服，用法与试验组一致","quote_sha256":"2e88dccfd7d3c5d34c99a3e98467a94d06c4669fcbcedfb27690d6a7a53e429e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","span_id":"es4"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es1","es2","es4"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"需确认安慰剂辅料组成、双盲维持措施（独立包装编码、紧急揭盲程序）","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_61_1","missing_source_classes":["药学研究资料（CMC）","双盲维持方案"],"target":"6.1 试验用药品"}],"heading":"试验用药品","missing_source_classes":["药学研究资料（CMC）","双盲维持方案"],"proposal_text":"本研究试验用药品为KZ-HS501（口服选择性TYK2变构抑制剂缓释片），属小分子药物，给药途径为口服，剂型为缓释片（口服固体制剂），拟规格为5mg、15mg、30mg薄膜衣片。试验组受试者接受KZ-HS501缓释片每日一次口服，每次一片，整片吞服不可掰开、压碎或咀嚼，空腹或餐后均可但须固定各自给药条件；漏服当日不补服，次日正常继续。对照组接受安慰剂缓释片，其外观、气味、规格与KZ-HS501匹配，每日一次口服，用法与试验组一致。组间按1:1:1:1平行分组（5mg、15mg、30mg剂量层与安慰剂），分层随机因素为基线HAS-IHS疼痛评分与Hurley分期。本研究设12周双盲剂量探索期（5mg、15mg、30mg三剂量层与安慰剂平行）与40周双盲PoC期，连续给药共52周。","rationale":"本章正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的试验药物名称、技术类型、剂型、规格、给药途径、给药方案、安慰剂匹配性、分组比例与分层因素、治疗周期等条目撰写。需医学经理与药学部门确认：安慰剂辅料组成、是否含活性成分痕迹、双盲维持措施（独立包装编码、紧急揭盲程序）、各规格片剂的具体辅料与包衣配方等实施细节。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_f4646e04bf3f_3bc05bd192c319a0","section_number":"6.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:84108f69c18a3caebea4ea31","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e35a8dbd3c7941"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261011030030_c12c8bc4","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","quote":"TYK2选择性抑制（与TYK2假激酶JH2结构域结合，抑制IL-23与IL-12下游JAK-STAT信号转导）","quote_sha256":"701bb2116f26f3ae166e3ab6389e616c739faad066edde5249df9666a490e43d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","span_id":"es5"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","quote":"食蟹猴4周毒理NOAEL 20mg/kg；暂无人体安全性数据","quote_sha256":"de00a96e1fd98487a6b8df457dcbd9e157cce7e24ebbd5be444cb47f65a4b914","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","span_id":"es6"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es5","es6"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"需获取完整IB或等效非临床安全性数据包以补充遗传毒性、生殖毒性、长期毒理及人体PK/PD信息","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_611_1","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）","完整非临床安全性数据包","人体PK/PD数据"],"target":"6.1.1 研究药物信息"}],"heading":"研究药物信息","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）","完整非临床安全性数据包","人体PK/PD数据","既往临床试验数据"],"proposal_text":"KZ-HS501为口服选择性TYK2变构抑制剂，其作用机制为与TYK2假激酶JH2结构域结合，抑制IL-23与IL-12下游JAK-STAT信号转导。该药物对人JAK1、JAK2、JAK3的选择性倍数高，提示其靶点选择性良好。非临床安全性方面，食蟹猴4周毒理试验的无可见不良反应剂量（NOAEL）为20mg/kg；目前暂无人体安全性数据。药代动力学方面，暂无人体PK数据。基于上述非临床安全性关注点，本研究特别关注的不良事件包括：感染（机会性感染、结核再激活）、肝功能异常（ALT或AST超过3倍正常值上限伴胆红素升高）、血脂异常（LDL-C显著升高）、中性粒细胞减少（ANC低于1.0×10⁹/L）、恶性肿瘤与严重心血管事件。","rationale":"本章正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的作用机制、非临床毒理数据、PK/PD考虑及特别关注不良事件条目撰写。需医学经理确认：完整非临床安全性数据包（含遗传毒性、生殖毒性、长期毒理）、人体PK/PD特征、既往临床试验数据（如有）等核心来源尚未提供，当前仅能写入已确认的有限信息。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_f4646e04bf3f_55308a871db33973","section_number":"6.1.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:84108f69c18a3caebea4ea31","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e35a8dbd3c7941"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261011030030_c12c8bc4","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"需获取KZ-HS501药学研究资料（CMC）或药物管理SOP以补充制备工艺、包装形式、标签要素、储存条件、发放与回收流程","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_612_1","missing_source_classes":["药学研究资料（CMC）","药物管理SOP","GMP生产文件","药物运输与储存规范"],"target":"6.1.2 制备、包装、标签、储存与管理"}],"heading":"制备、包装、标签、储存与管理","missing_source_classes":["药学研究资料（CMC）","药物管理SOP","GMP生产文件","药物运输与储存规范"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章涉及KZ-HS501的制备工艺、包装形式、标签内容要素、储存温度与湿度条件、有效期、运输条件、药物发放与回收流程、药物计数记录方式等具体操作规范。允许来源中未提供上述任何项目级实施细节，公司语料中关于eCRF记录药物过量或给药错误的条目属监管共性结构参考，不构成制备、包装、储存与管理的实质内容。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_f4646e04bf3f_92aa9ea5b2043d91","section_number":"6.1.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:84108f69c18a3caebea4ea31","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e35a8dbd3c7941"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"6c5d7f4ebb572288751db09958ac86391f7190f1a038e68e73f9196133becd89","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_f4646e04bf3f_32980b414dd10a90:full-draft:84108f69c18a3caebea4ea31","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:84108f69c18a3caebea4ea31","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:3f113b3078eeadf627add85b70f8595012efb68d7ada6f6ed893a92c895ebf13:84108f69c18a3caebea4ea31","text_sha256":"6c5d7f4ebb572288751db09958ac86391f7190f1a038e68e73f9196133becd89"},{"content_sha256":"bc4292fbd9da1f3f8068cfc21dddd39f03e0987afbe785dc729755092025cd55","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"cur